### Cleanup — delete mock gate
DELETE {{RUUTER_URL}}/admin/v1/gates/EU-MOCK
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

> {%
  client.test("Mock gate deleted", () => {
    client.assert(response.status === 204)
  })
%}
